-*   **Volume Set**: Binding 0: Volume texture, Binding 1: Transfer function texture [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Eye Set**: Binding 0: Volume texture, Binding 1: Transfer function texture, Binding 2: Light buffer (2D texture) [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Composite Set**: Binding 0: Eye buffer (render target) [S1, unofficial].
